# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: YSFlight.
Package: YSFlight
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Components: Apps.Games.!YSFlight (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-ysflight
Description: Free flight simulator (YSFlight Community Edition)
 Fly YSFlight's aircraft in a desktop window or full screen with
 software OpenGL, sound and USB joysticks. About 22 frames a second
 at 640x480 on a Pi 4. ARMv7 with VFP.
Build-Map: !YSFlight -> Apps/Games/!YSFlight
Build-Untyped: auto
Build-Notice: YSFlight Community Edition, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-ysflight/releases
 .
 YSFlight Community Edition (github.com/YSCEDC/YSCE) is under the BSD
 3-clause licence, which follows.
Build-Copyright: !YSFlight/Licence
Build-Copyright: !YSFlight/PThreadTicker-Licence
